    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15211" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρκύ-στᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Or.</u>
			1421
		</span></i> (lyr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκυς,
			ἵστημι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beset with nets,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀρκυστάταν μηχανὰν ἐμπλέκειν
			παῖδα</span> into <i>the hunter's toils,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρκύστατα, τά,</span>
			<i>surrounding toils, a place beset with nets,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1476
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1375
			</span></i> Elmsl.</div>
